---
const stages = [
  {
    date: "1910s",
    title: "Metaphysical plaza",
    work: "de Chirico",
    operation: "Perspective makes the physical city lose its ordinary explanation.",
    className: "plaza",
  },
  {
    date: "1982",
    title: "Electronic world",
    work: "TRON",
    operation: "Perspective becomes a coordinate system, landscape, and physics.",
    className: "grid",
  },
  {
    date: "1982",
    title: "City as circuit",
    work: "Koyaanisqatsi",
    operation: "Montage finds the same repeated pathways in streets, chips, and textiles.",
    className: "circuit",
  },
  {
    date: "2011",
    title: "Memory container",
    work: "Floral Shoppe",
    operation: "Synthetic depth holds fragments from several incompatible times.",
    className: "shoppe",
  },
];
---

<figure class="spatial-logic article-wide not-prose">
  <header>
    <div>
      <span>Recurring spatial logic</span>
      <h3>Perspective becomes system</h3>
    </div>
    <strong>Formal comparison, not an influence chain</strong>
  </header>
  <ol>
    {stages.map((stage) => (
      <li>
        <div class={`spatial-logic__field ${stage.className}`} aria-hidden="true">
          <i></i><i></i><i></i>
        </div>
        <div class="spatial-logic__copy">
          <span>{stage.date}</span>
          <h4>{stage.title}</h4>
          <b>{stage.work}</b>
          <p>{stage.operation}</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>
  <figcaption>
    The documented influence history stays separate: Nietzsche informed de Chirico, and de Chirico became important to Surrealists including Magritte. The four-part sequence above tracks a visual rhyme across works, not a claimed line of production influence.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .spatial-logic {
    margin-block: 2.7rem !important;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgb(255 94 203 / 0.38);
    background: #080611;
    box-shadow: 0.65rem 0.72rem 0 rgb(4 2 10 / 0.3);
  }

  header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(85 234 219 / 0.22);
  }

  header span,
  header strong,
  .spatial-logic__copy > span {
    color: #55eadb;
    font: 750 0.62rem/1.3 var(--font-mono), monospace;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  header h3 {
    margin: 0.18rem 0 0;
    color: #fff;
    font: 650 clamp(1.15rem, 3vw, 1.65rem)/1.15 var(--font-display), Georgia, serif;
  }

  header strong {
    max-width: 13rem;
    color: #ff7fd6;
    text-align: right;
  }

  ol {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  li {
    min-width: 0;
    border-right: 1px solid rgb(85 234 219 / 0.16);
  }

  li:last-child {
    border-right: 0;
  }

  .spatial-logic__field {
    position: relative;
    height: 8.4rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #11101b;
  }

  .spatial-logic__field::before,
  .spatial-logic__field::after,
  .spatial-logic__field i {
    position: absolute;
    display: block;
    content: "";
  }

  .plaza {
    background: linear-gradient(#69c2be 0 47%, #c88758 47%);
  }

  .plaza::before {
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 62%;
    height: 55%;
    clip-path: polygon(40% 0, 100% 15%, 100% 100%, 0 100%);
    background: #8a3a51;
  }

  .plaza::after {
    bottom: 0;
    left: 29%;
    width: 2px;
    height: 54%;
    background: #342039;
    box-shadow: 1.3rem 0.4rem 0 #342039, 2.8rem 0.9rem 0 #342039;
    transform: rotate(54deg);
    transform-origin: bottom;
  }

  .grid {
    background: linear-gradient(#05061a 0 44%, #17082a 44%);
  }

  .grid::before {
    inset: 44% -30% -30%;
    background:
      repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0 1.5rem, rgb(85 234 219 / 0.75) 1.54rem 1.6rem),
      repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent 0 1.25rem, rgb(255 94 203 / 0.58) 1.3rem 1.36rem);
    transform: perspective(8rem) rotateX(58deg);
    transform-origin: top;
  }

  .grid::after {
    top: 43%;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 1px;
    background: #55eadb;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0.6rem #55eadb;
  }

  .circuit {
    background:
      linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 48%, rgb(255 188 83 / 0.8) 49% 51%, transparent 52%),
      linear-gradient(#0c1022, #261135);
  }

  .circuit::before {
    inset: 0;
    background:
      repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0 1.1rem, rgb(85 234 219 / 0.22) 1.12rem 1.22rem),
      repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent 0 1.1rem, rgb(255 94 203 / 0.2) 1.12rem 1.22rem);
  }

  .circuit::after {
    top: 26%;
    left: 15%;
    width: 0.5rem;
    height: 0.5rem;
    border: 1px solid #55eadb;
    background: #090814;
    box-shadow: 2.3rem 1.4rem 0 #ff5ecb, 4.7rem 0.2rem 0 #55eadb, 1rem 4rem 0 #ffcc65, 5.6rem 4.4rem 0 #ff5ecb;
  }

  .shoppe {
    background: linear-gradient(#f59ecf 0 42%, #8049ab 42%);
  }

  .shoppe::before {
    inset: 42% -30% -30%;
    background:
      repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0 1.25rem, rgb(255 255 255 / 0.62) 1.27rem 1.34rem),
      repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent 0 1rem, rgb(255 255 255 / 0.55) 1.04rem 1.1rem);
    transform: perspective(8rem) rotateX(58deg);
    transform-origin: top;
  }

  .shoppe::after {
    top: 1rem;
    left: 50%;
    width: 2.8rem;
    height: 3.5rem;
    border-radius: 50% 50% 42% 42%;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f5e9e3, #bea6cc 58%, #f5e9e3);
    box-shadow: 0 0.55rem 0 -0.2rem rgb(255 255 255 / 0.35);
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }

  .spatial-logic__copy {
    min-height: 12rem;
    padding: 0.8rem;
  }

  .spatial-logic__copy h4 {
    margin: 0.32rem 0 0.1rem;
    color: #fff;
    font: 650 0.95rem/1.18 var(--font-display), Georgia, serif;
  }

  .spatial-logic__copy b {
    color: #ff7fd6;
    font: 700 0.66rem/1.3 var(--font-mono), monospace;
  }

  .spatial-logic__copy p {
    margin: 0.65rem 0 0 !important;
    color: #b9b0c0 !important;
    font-size: 0.73rem !important;
    line-height: 1.5 !important;
  }

  figcaption {
    margin: 0 !important;
    padding: 0.8rem 1rem 0.9rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgb(85 234 219 / 0.2);
    color: #a89db1;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    text-align: left !important;
  }

  @media (max-width: 46rem) {
    ol {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    li:nth-child(2) {
      border-right: 0;
    }

    li:nth-child(-n + 2) {
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(85 234 219 / 0.16);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 29rem) {
    header {
      align-items: start;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    header strong {
      text-align: left;
    }

    ol {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    li,
    li:nth-child(2) {
      border-right: 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(85 234 219 / 0.16);
    }

    li:last-child {
      border-bottom: 0;
    }

    .spatial-logic__copy {
      min-height: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
